  "prompt": "Check that Voltmarkt's sales view adds up for April 2025, channel by channel. For each channel, compare the revenue in sales (order_date is the UTC day of order_ts) with the revenue worked out from order_lines and orders: quantity times unit_price_eur minus line_discount_eur, for every line of an order whose order_ts, a UTC time, falls in April. Return four columns, in this order: channel, sales_revenue, lines_revenue and difference (sales_revenue minus lines_revenue). Return one row for each channel. Any row order is fine.",
